---
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer
  id="contatti"
  class="mx-4 mt-16 text-center text-black rounded-lg shadow-3xl dark:shadow-3xl lg:text-left bg-thi_color dark:bg-sec_color lg:mx-20">
  <div class="container pb-5 md:text-left">
    <div class="flex md:justify-center">
      <h2 class="pt-12 pb-12 ml-5 text-3xl font-extrabold text-left text-white sm:text-4xl md:ml-0 dark:text-slate-600">
        Contatti
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="l-r max-w-[75rem] mx-auto py-8 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between">
      <div class="w-full animate__animated destra2 md:w-auto lg:flex">
        <div class="mb-5 w-28 grayscale">
          <img
            class="w-12 h-12 dark:rounded-lg"
            title="Ilaria Mezzanotti"
            src="/assets/img/dark_logo_.webp"
            width="499"
            height="501"
            alt="Logo Dott.ssa Ilaria Mezzanotti"
          />
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="flex items-center mb-5 font-medium md:justify-start">
            <i class="mr-4 text-3xl text-white fas fa-phone-square-alt dark:text-slate-600" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            <a
              title="cellulare"
              itemprop="url"
              href="tel:+393663712597"
              class="px-2 py-1 text-sm text-white transition ease-in-out rounded-md hover:scale-110 delay-50 shadow-3xl dark:shadow-3xl dark:text-slate-600">
              366 3712597
            </a>
          </p>
          <p class="flex items-center mb-5 font-medium md:justify-start">
            <i class="mr-4 text-3xl text-white fab fa-facebook-square dark:text-slate-600" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            <a
              title="facebook"
              itemprop="url"
              href="https://www.facebook.com/ilaria.mezzanotti.3"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="px-2 py-1 mr-6 text-sm font-medium text-white transition ease-in-out rounded-md hover:scale-110 delay-50 shadow-3xl dark:shadow-3xl dark:text-slate-600">
              Ilaria Mezzanotti
            </a>
          </p>
          <p class="flex items-center mb-5 font-medium md:justify-start">
            <i class="mr-4 text-3xl text-white fab fa-linkedin dark:text-slate-600" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            <a
              title="linkedin"
              itemprop="url"
              href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/dott-ssa-ilaria-mezzanotti-026551162/"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="px-2 py-1 mr-6 text-sm font-medium text-white transition ease-in-out rounded-md hover:scale-110 delay-50 shadow-3xl dark:shadow-3xl dark:text-slate-600">
              Dott.ssa Ilaria Mezzanotti
            </a>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="flex items-center mb-5 font-medium md:justify-start">
            <i class="mr-4 text-3xl text-white fab fa-instagram-square dark:text-slate-600" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            <a
              title="instagram"
              itemprop="url"
              href="https://www.instagram.com/ilaria.mezzanotti_psicologa/"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="px-2 py-1 mr-6 text-sm font-medium text-white transition ease-in-out rounded-md hover:scale-110 delay-50 shadow-3xl dark:shadow-3xl dark:text-slate-600">
              ilaria.mezzanotti_psicologa
            </a>
          </p>
          <p class="flex items-center mb-5 font-medium md:justify-start">
            <i class="mr-4 text-3xl text-white fas fa-envelope-square dark:text-slate-600" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            <a
              itemprop="url"
              title="email"
              href="https://mail.google.com/mail/?view=cm&fs=1&tf=1&to=ilaria.mezzanotti@gmail.com"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="px-2 py-1 text-sm text-white transition ease-in-out rounded-md hover:scale-110 delay-50 shadow-3xl dark:shadow-3xl dark:text-slate-600">
              ilaria.mezzanotti@gmail.com
            </a>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="p-2 text-center bg-sec_color">
    <small class="text-white">
      © <span id="year">{currentYear}</span> Ilaria Mezzanotti. Tutti i diritti riservati.
    </small>
  </div>

  <div class="px-6 pt-2 pb-4 text-center rounded-b-lg bg-sec_color">
    <button
      id="cookieToggle"
      class="flex items-center justify-center gap-1 mx-auto cursor-pointer bg-transparent border-0 text-white/80 hover:text-white text-[10px] leading-relaxed p-1 transition-colors duration-300"
      aria-expanded="false"
      aria-controls="cookieText">
      <i class="fa-solid fa-cookie-bite" aria-hidden="true"></i>
      <span>Cookie Policy</span>
      <i
        id="cookieChevron"
        class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down transition-transform duration-300 ease-in-out"
        aria-hidden="true"></i>
    </button>
    <div id="cookieText" class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out max-h-0">
      <p class="text-[10px] leading-relaxed text-white/80 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
        Questo sito utilizza esclusivamente cookie tecnici necessari al funzionamento e non raccoglie dati
        personali degli utenti. <br />Non vengono utilizzati cookie di profilazione né strumenti di tracciamento
        di terze parti.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
